# Flow: validation — empty input (400) — see ../workflow-flow.md

### 1) start process with empty input (ValidateInputDelegate rejects empty input)
< ../../../scripts/traceparent.js
POST {{host}}/restapi/workflow
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json
traceparent: 00-{{traceId}}-{{spanId}}-03
baggage: testBaggage=workflow-operaton-hello-world

{
    "input": ""
}

> {%
    client.test("empty input returns 400", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 400, "expected 400 but got " + response.status);
    });
%}
